# Tests of the `heap` module; generated from tools/heap.dsl by tools/build.py. They run under
# `refined test`, where machine and system targets work in the JIT's own process.

takeTest is test
takeTest purpose "A block from the heap is zeroed, can be written, grows with its bytes kept, and goes back"
takeTest verifies take takesZeroed
